<title>UK: BOE allots 204 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 204 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with 204 million stg of assistance at midday.</p>
<p>It allotted 59 million stg in bills outright and 145 million in 6.0 percent repos to May 15 and 16.</p>
<p>The Bank revised its liquidity shortage forecast to 1.85 billion stg from the initial estimate of 1.8 billion.</p>
</text>
